So it doesn't mean you have to cry, but I think kind of genuine sense of feeling, and that is more important.

118
00:18:15,079 --> 00:18:18,042
So I have teaching went on like that every day, one word, one word.

119
00:18:19,483 --> 00:18:27,290
So just to get kind of deep sense of feeling into this four karhita, four thoughts of, yes, turn your mind.

120
